  Note: Downloads the external package and only checks existence/non-empty size. The SHA256 is calculated after download and exported, not compared against a trusted expected value.

github/workflows/release.yml (L210 to 219)
  Note: Copies the unverified downloaded package into both release package directories that become user-facing release zips.

github/workflows/release.yml (L22 to 23)
  Note: Defines the external GitHub release asset URL and package name, but no expected hash or signature is pinned in the workflow.

github/workflows/release.yml (L222 to 243)
  Note: The release signature covers only the standalone executable, so it does not authenticate the bundled Unity package inside the zips.

github/workflows/release.yml (L296 to 300)
  Note: Build metadata records the package hash after the fact, which is useful for reporting but does not prevent a compromised or replaced external package from being bundled.

